{
  "title": { "en": "As many as you like" },
  "short": { "en": "The same kind, again" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "en": "This time you pack in a shop: there is plenty of every kind of thing, and <b>you can take several of the same kind</b>. The total weight still can’t exceed the backpack’s capacity."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "en": "The table is the same knapsack table: cell (row i, capacity w) records <b>the most value you can pack choosing only from the first i kinds, with capacity w</b>. Only one thing differs from <level-ref to=\"knaptable\"></level-ref>: after taking one, you can take the same kind again."
      },
      "fig": {
